## Bundled dependencies in shipped artefacts

`tools/mcp-engine.mjs` (the MCP router engine, built by `tools/build-mcp.mjs`) and the offline
verification bundles under `verify/suites/` are self-contained: npm dependencies are compiled
into them so they run with no `node_modules`. The engine bundles **zod** (MIT © Colin McDonnell)
and the offline bundles bundle the same runtime dependencies as the product's `package.json`.

